If you change database credentials,
DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=mysql
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=laravel
DB_USERNAME=laravel
DB_PASSWORD=laravel

update them in **both** places:
1) `app/.env`
2) `docker-compose.yml` (under the `mysql` service `environment` section)

To set up and run the application, use the appropriate setup script for your operating system:
-- setup.sh (Mac/Linux)
chmod +x setup.sh
./setup.sh

-- setup.bat (Windows)
Double click .bat file